<headline>TENNIS-SABATINI'S CAREER STATISTICS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Career statistics of Gabriela</p>
<p>Sabatini, who announced her retirement on Thursday:</p>
