<p>Birthplace: Buenos Aires, Argentina</p>
<p>Residence: Buenos Aires and Key Biscayne, Florida</p>
<p>Turned Pro: January 1, 1985</p>
<p>Career Titles: 27</p>
<p>1985 - Japan Open</p>
<p>1986 - Argentinian Open</p>
<p>1987 - Brighton, Pan Pacific, Argentinian Open</p>
<p>1988 - Virginia Slims Championships, Boca Raton, Italian</p>
<p>Open, Canadian Open</p>
<p>1989 - Lipton, Amelia Island, Italian Open, Filderstadt</p>
<p>1990 - U.S. Open, Boca Raton</p>
<p>1991 - Pan Pacific, Boca Raton, Hilton Head, Amelia</p>
<p>Island, Italian Open</p>
<p>1992 - Sydney, Pan Pacific, Hilton Head, Amelia Island,</p>
<p>Italian Open</p>
<p>1993 - none</p>
<p>1994 - Virginia Slims Championships</p>
<p>1995 - Sydney</p>
